            "review_text": "pirret\nNorwich, United Kingdom185 contributions\n1\nA Thai restaurant which doesn’t serve Thai curry\nJan 2020 • Couples\nMy husband and I went to this restaurant as it was opposite our hotel. There was no Thai red curry on the menu, so I ordered a yellow curry. After a while I was told that this was not available, but that I could have a green Thai curry, which I accepted. I was then told that this was not available either and there was nothing else on the menu which I would have eaten. We left.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2020",
